      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "emotion",
        "mental",
        "visual"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The veolisk's eyes exude the dark, claustrophobic aspects of deep space. A creature the veolisk can see within 30 feet must attempt a DC 24 Will Saving Throw save. If it fails, it becomes Off-Guard until the end of the veolisk's next turn. On a critical failure, or on a failure if the creature was already off-guard from this ability or Void Glance, the creature instead becomes Confused until the end of the veolisk's next turn.</p>",
